<title>USA: Caraustar Industries repurchases stock.</title>
<headline>Caraustar Industries repurchases stock.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caraustar Industries Inc said Monday it has completed the purchase of one million shares of its common stock pursuant to the Feb 2 authorization by its board of directors.</p>
<p>The company said funding for the purchases was from internally generated funds and borrowings under the company's revolving credit facility.</p>
<p>Caraustar produces recycled paperboard and manufactures paper tubes and cores, composite containers, folding cartons, plastic products, adhesives, industrial and consumer packaging.</p>
</text>
